      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. But when you talk about 'initial cultural friction,' what do people in these studies actually report as the main friction points? I'm trying to be specific in my report—is it usually related to changes in local business types, noise/lifestyle habits, or does it get more serious, like an actual breakdown in trust or community cohesion between the old and new residents?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
